  "end": 1477.41,
  "text": "And I'm just going to ask you, please, you know, we are listening to you all attentively. This is a chamber, and we're conducting a meeting. So I would appreciate it if we all gave everyone our full attention and maintained decorum in the, in the chamber. Thank you."
